{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2019-10-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE AND PANA-PACIFIC COLLABORATES TO EXTEND THE BENEFITS OF VIDEO INTELLIGENCE FOR TRANSPORTATION', 'text': "TRIMBLE ANNOUNCED THAT PANA-PACIFIC, WILL SELL TRIMBLE VIDEO EQUIPMENT FOR USE WITH A SUBSCRIPTION TO TRIMBLE'S VIDEO INTELLIGENCE™ SOLUTION. THROUGH THE COLLABORATION, PANA-PACIFIC WILL MARKET BOTH TWO AND FOUR-CHANNEL DIGITAL VIDEO RECORDERS (DVRS) AND A VARIETY OF CAMERAS TO THE OEM HEAVY-DUTY TRUCK DEALER NETWORK. TRIMBLE'S VIDEO INTELLIGENCE GIVES FLEETS A 360-DEGREE VIEW IN AND AROUND COMPANY VEHICLES USING FORWARD, SIDE AND REAR-FACING CAMERAS. THROUGH THIS NEUTRAL EYEWITNESS PERSPECTIVE, FLEETS CAN RECORD VIDEO EVIDENCE IN THE EVENT OF AN ACCIDENT AS WELL AS ENHANCE COACHING OPPORTUNITIES WITH COMPANY DRIVERS."}